From a4634e2e639e984c2f84270cd9c2bb415ab67875 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 7 May 2025 17:34:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] i2c: Add support for NOP Frame

Add support for NOP Frame. This NOP Frame can be used
to consume the sync or CDM trigger without any data
transfer on the lines.

Apart from this add the NULL check to avoid derefernce
issue in configure mode path.

Change-Id: Ibbe3c85b28e2d7c297dc979154f2b89f0e77efa2
Signed-off-by: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
